29
01:04.930 --> 01:09.930
So one, two, three, four, five spots until it's right here.

30
01:10.710 --> 01:12.650
So because we moved it five spots now,

31
01:12.650 --> 01:17.312
we're going to get four point zero times 10 to the five

32
01:17.312 --> 01:19.670
and we keep this as a positive five because we

33
01:19.670 --> 01:21.630
