02:50.700 --> 02:52.530
and they both have an exponent, we can add

72
02:52.530 --> 02:53.630
those exponents together.

73
02:53.630 --> 02:55.890
So negative one plus a negative eight is going

74
02:55.890 --> 02:57.330
