84
03:19.290 --> 03:22.070
Six can't go into three, but it can go into 36

85
03:22.070 --> 03:25.100
six times, so we get 36 and zero.

86
03:25.100 --> 03:27.620
So we know we have an answer of point six here.

87
03:27.620 --> 03:30.330
So we're going to get point six, and then for

88
03:30.330 --> 03:33.049
10 to the negative eight divided by 10 to the negative two,

