96
03:45.810 --> 03:47.990
Adding that down here, we get times 10 to

97
03:47.990 --> 03:49.890
the negative six, but we're not quite in

98
03:49.890 --> 03:51.150
scientific notation yet.

99
03:51.150 --> 03:54.470
